```
The 2 x 1 dominoes can be either placed vertically or horizontally. Therefore, for a 3 x n board, we can count the ways by considering two cases:
1. Placement of the first two dominoes vertically, in which case the remaining board becomes 2 x (n-2) for N-2 iterations.
2. Placement of the first two dominoes horizontally, in which case the remaining board becomes 3 x (n-2) for N-2 iterations.
The total number of ways are the sum of these two possibilities.

