This function implements the bilinear method to find the length of the longest bitonic subsequence in the given array. The lis array stores the length of the longest increasing subsequence ending at each index, and the LDS array stores the length of the longest decreasing subsequence starting at each index. By combining these arrays, we can determine the length of the longest bitonic subsequence.

